## The runtime
```
state, effects = init(machine); execute(effects)
while state is active:
  event = nextEvent(); state, effects = transition(machine, state, event); execute(effects)
return state.output
```

## Workspace map
- `machine.md`   — the machine (planner-authored, orchestrator-linted, executed mechanically)
- `state.md`     — current state, row visits, event queue, output — the volatile truth
- `events.md`    — append-only transition log — the audit trail
- `progress.md`  — digest; subagents append one line per unit; collapsed into events
- `cheatsheet.md`— self-populating environment knowledge
- `prompts/`     — initialiser, planner, builder, sub-subagent, measurement — dispatched BY PATH
- `units/`       — one file per unit; no shared write targets

## Resume
Trust disk: read state.md + events.md tail, reconcile `git log` (prefix
`workmachine(<state>/<unit>)`) against progress.md, confirm prompts/ holds all
five role files (re-run the scaffold with --force if not), re-execute any
mid-flight effects, then continue at nextEvent().
